Modern townhouses Azizi Florence in Um Fanain

Azizi Florence in Um Fanain - six architectural clusters with Italian character
Azizi Florence is a gated community by Azizi Developments in the developing area of Um Fanain, Sharjah. On an area of ​​73 hectares there are six independent clusters, each with its own architectural concept.
Lucardo, Bellarno and Soffiano are designed in a modern style - with laconic geometry, large windows and a restrained color palette. Versilia, Pienza and Siena are inspired by Mediterranean aesthetics: warm shades, arcades and expressive plastic facades.
The project combines the privacy of a gated community, developed internal infrastructure and convenient transport accessibility. Um Fanain is undergoing active development, making Azizi Florence of interest both for family living and for buyers looking at UAE property with long-term investment potential. The project is scheduled for completion in Q3 2029.
Infrastructure Azizi Florence
Inside the community there are spaces for relaxation, sports and everyday tasks:
— a central park with pedestrian and bicycle paths;
— children's play areas;
— sports grounds;
— dancing fountains;
— swimming pools and recreation areas;
— shopping center on the territory of the complex;
— medical clinic;
- two mosques;
- closed protected area with controlled entry.
Location – Um Fanain, Sharjah
Azizi Florence is located close to Sharjah's key transport destinations, providing convenient connections to airports, the university cluster and Dubai:
— 10 minutes to Sharjah International Airport;
- 10 minutes to Sharjah University;
— 15 minutes to Emirates Road;
— 20 minutes to Dubai International Airport;
— direct exit to Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road.
Um Fanain is a developing residential area of ​​Sharjah, where predominantly low-rise buildings are being formed, aimed at family living. Proximity to major highways allows convenient travel between Sharjah and Dubai, while maintaining the benefits of a more tranquil countryside environment.
Want to know more about Azizi Florence? Contact us - we will provide current prices and availability of residences by cluster, send you layouts and select the best option for your budget and purpose of purchase.
