The project combines modern architecture, a comfortable living environment and a varied infrastructure for residents. One of the key benefits is a flexible 60/40 payment plan with postpaid for 40 months, allowing you to distribute the financial burden over a long period.
Dubailand Residence Complex is a developing residential area with convenient access to key locations in Dubai and major transport routes. A more affordable entry fee compared to central areas and flexible payment terms make Jura Terraces an interesting option both for your own residence and for an investment purchase.
